WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.027 --> 00:00:07.003
The Carters got into the car.

2
00:00:07.004 --> 00:00:12.646
"Is everybody ready for my first baseball game?" Dad asked.

3
00:00:12.647 --> 00:00:15.121
Oliver held up a ball.

4
00:00:15.122 --> 00:00:21.133
"I'm ready for a famous player to sign my baseball!"

5
00:00:21.134 --> 00:00:27.417
Dad smiled. "There won't be any famous players.

6
00:00:27.418 --> 00:00:31.495
Just dads playing for fun."

7
00:00:31.496 --> 00:00:36.444
"Will you hit a home run?" Oliver asked.

8
00:00:36.445 --> 00:00:40.839
"I'll be happy if I don't strike out," Dad said.

9
00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:47.791
"I can't wait to see the big stadium!" Oliver said.

10
00:00:47.792 --> 00:00:50.472
The Carters arrived at the game.

11
00:00:50.473 --> 00:00:56.411
Oliver looked around. "This is just a field."

12
00:00:56.412 --> 00:01:01.744
Emmy shrugged. "At least there are seats."

13
00:01:01.745 --> 00:01:10.960
Dad was playing first base.

14
00:01:10.961 --> 00:01:17.890
"I hope he doesn't make any errors," Harry said.

15
00:01:17.891 --> 00:01:26.412
Dad made one error and struck out twice.

16
00:01:26.413 --> 00:01:29.158
Oliver got bored.

17
00:01:29.159 --> 00:01:33.862
"Can we leave?" he asked in the fifth inning.

18
00:01:33.863 --> 00:01:38.294
"No," Mom said.

19
00:01:38.295 --> 00:01:43.083
Oliver fell asleep in the sixth inning.

20
00:01:43.084 --> 00:01:49.604
Finally it was the bottom of the ninth inning.

21
00:01:49.605 --> 00:01:52.206
The score was tied.

22
00:01:52.207 --> 00:01:57.006
Dad was on second base.

23
00:01:57.007 --> 00:02:03.772
Whack! Dad's teammate hit a long ball.

24
00:02:03.773 --> 00:02:10.179
"Run, Dad!" Emmy yelled.

25
00:02:10.180 --> 00:02:16.219
Oliver woke up as Dad crossed home plate.

26
00:02:16.220 --> 00:02:22.672
"We won!" Oliver jumped up.

27
00:02:22.673 --> 00:02:27.531
He ran onto the field and hugged Dad.

28
00:02:27.532 --> 00:02:31.624
Oliver gave Dad his ball to sign.

29
00:02:31.625 --> 00:02:36.774
"This isn't a big baseball stadium," Oliver said.

30
00:02:36.775 --> 00:02:42.750
"But you're still a big star!"

